The Player Problem: The share of space portioned to different audio playback devices in Audio Magazine between 1973-1999
Authors: Marcus Fryd
Keywords: Text mining; Audio Magazine; Physical media; Playback equipment

Final project for Digital Archives and Methods due 26/05/2026.

*NOTICE ABOUT AUDIO MAGAZINES*
Due to the sheer amount of files, I have had to upload them to Science Data. They can be accessed via the link: 
https://sciencedata.dk/shared/cb82ebe07257c20463a32eaac4dba408
